# VTuber Hub Architecture Rules

1. Security & Architecture
   - Keep all recommendation and scraping logic inside Server Actions or API routes (`actions/`, `lib/`).
   - NEVER expose secret keys or raw scraping algorithms to the client (`"use client"`).

2. Optimization & Caching
   - Always use Upstash Redis caching for live statuses and list outputs.
   - Use external thumbnail URLs directly (Embeds) to save local storage.

3. Tech Stack
   - Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Supabase, Upstash Redis.